Local data directory for MosaicLeaks generation.

Symlink or copy the following files here before running the pipeline:

  chunks_local.jsonl        - Local document chunks
  chunks_web.jsonl          - Primary fixed-corpus web chunks
  secret_inventory.jsonl    - Secret inventory with doc_only_check annotations
  chunks_curated_web.jsonl  - Optional curated web chunks
  docs_curated_web.jsonl    - Optional curated web metadata for allowlisting
  tasks/                    - Optional task configs used by curated URL refresh tools

The entity index cache will also be stored here.

These files are gitignored on purpose so you can keep large local artifacts here
without staging them.
